# Data Fetching & API

- **TanStack Query**: Use structured query keys (e.g., `['users', userId]`) for server state. Encapsulate query logic strictly inside custom hooks.
- **REST API**: Resource URLs must use plural nouns and `kebab-case`. Do NOT use verbs (get, create) in URLs. Represent hierarchy via URL paths.